    "definition_type_raw": "Combat, Item Mastery",
    "source_book_raw": "Pathfinder Player Companion: Weapon Master’s Handbook",
    "definition_raw": "You can coax telekinesis from transmutation magic items.\n\nPrerequisite(s): Use Magic Device 5 ranks, base Fortitude save bonus +7.\n\nBenefit(s): You can cause an item that has a transmutation spell of 4th level or higher in its construction requirements to cast telekinesis.\n\nYou can use this feat once per day, plus an additional time per day at base Fortitude save bonus +9 and +11.",
